  - m_Id: 4807462912
    m_Localized: Routed Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6850088960
    m_Localized: Having a full bottle will block the next enemy attack if its color
      matches with the bottle's. This drains {buff_0}% of the color in that bottle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999611
  - m_Id: 141441889403572224
    m_Localized: Having a full bottle will block damage from similarly colored enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999611
  - m_Id: 141441905027354624
    m_Localized: This contraption seems to route away danger. I actually haven't
      seen such an item before.
